00:48:37.247 --> 00:48:38.982
trying to say that being
a woman is terrible today,

00:48:38.982 --> 00:48:40.450
it's a victim class.

00:48:40.450 --> 00:48:43.720 align:start size:97% position:3%
A lot of feminists have
decided it's a victim class.

00:48:43.720 --> 00:48:47.090
I mean, looking at the way
lesbians are treated today.

00:48:47.090 --> 00:48:48.659
Their bars are disappearing.

00:48:48.659 --> 00:48:50.193
They are harassed.

00:48:50.193 --> 00:48:51.995
A lot of lesbians have told
me that their social groups

00:48:51.995 --> 00:48:55.599
have had to go online because
they are so often harassed

00:48:55.599 --> 00:49:00.570 align:start size:88% position:13%
by transgender adults
who claim to be lesbians

00:49:01.438 --> 00:49:02.606
and come on to them sexually.

00:49:03.507 --> 00:49:06.143
You know, this is a very...

00:49:06.143 --> 00:49:09.780
It's tough to be a woman
today and in certain sense.

00:49:09.780 --> 00:49:11.248
And we've lost...

00:49:11.248 --> 00:49:13.684 align:start size:97% position:3%
And not a lot of women are
standing up for women's rights

00:49:13.684 --> 00:49:14.918
and the rights of girls

00:49:14.918 --> 00:49:16.954 align:start size:84% position:16%
to be whatever kind
of girl they wanna be.

00:49:16.954 --> 00:49:18.021
- You know, it's so fascinating

00:49:18.021 --> 00:49:19.222
'cause if you would have said

00:49:19.222 --> 00:49:20.624 align:start size:84% position:16%
what you just said
there, four years ago,

00:49:20.624 --> 00:49:22.459
look what's happening to
lesbians being harassed,

00:49:22.459 --> 00:49:23.727
blah, blah, blah.

00:49:23.727 --> 00:49:24.661
If you would've said
that four years ago,

00:49:24.661 --> 00:49:25.896
people would have thought,

00:49:25.896 --> 00:49:27.698
oh, she means that
people on the right

00:49:27.698 --> 00:49:29.967 align:start size:94% position:6%
or Christian
conservatives or something

00:49:29.967 --> 00:49:31.468
are coming after lesbians.

00:49:31.468 --> 00:49:34.404 align:start size:97% position:3%
And it's simply, well, it
barely exists at this point,

00:49:34.404 --> 00:49:36.039
at least in an American context.

00:49:36.039 --> 00:49:37.307
But what you're talking about

00:49:37.307 --> 00:49:39.876
is being bullied by the
trans people and saying,

00:49:39.876 --> 00:49:41.478
if you're not attracted to me

00:49:41.478 --> 00:49:43.347 align:start size:94% position:6%
now that I've transitioned
or something else,

00:49:43.347 --> 00:49:45.115
now you're a transphobe.

00:49:45.115 --> 00:49:46.683
And that's really fascinating

00:49:46.683 --> 00:49:48.785
how quickly that has all shifted

00:49:48.785 --> 00:49:50.120
- Yeah, and it's the activist.

00:49:50.120 --> 00:49:51.388
Look, I can't tell you,

00:49:51.388 --> 00:49:53.490
I've interviewed a
lot of trans women

00:49:53.490 --> 00:49:56.426 align:start size:97% position:3%
who would be horrified to make
other women uncomfortable,

00:49:56.426 --> 00:49:57.494
make women uncomfortable.

00:49:57.494 --> 00:49:59.396
They would never harass women.

00:49:59.396 --> 00:50:02.933 align:start position:0%
But unfortunately this activist
group is taking advantage.

00:50:02.933 --> 00:50:06.003 align:start size:84% position:16%
I mean, you know,
you see this all over

00:50:06.003 --> 00:50:07.304
in so many ways.

00:50:07.304 --> 00:50:10.007
Smith College, which
was always all-women

00:50:10.007 --> 00:50:12.809
