00:50:13.977 --> 00:50:15.345 align:start size:81% position:19% line:0%
You know, lesbians
who try to have

00:50:15.345 --> 00:50:17.714 line:0%
their own social groups or bars,

00:50:17.714 --> 00:50:19.449 line:0%
they're constantly harassed

00:50:19.449 --> 00:50:22.019
by biological men who
claim to be women.

00:50:22.019 --> 00:50:24.354
And are forcing their way in.

00:50:24.354 --> 00:50:26.857 align:start size:94% position:6%
Battered women's
shelters, the same thing.

00:50:26.857 --> 00:50:28.158
Prisons in California.

00:50:28.158 --> 00:50:29.593
If you say you're a woman,

00:50:29.593 --> 00:50:31.828
you get housed with
the women prisoners.

00:50:31.828 --> 00:50:34.031 align:start size:84% position:16%
And this is obviously
very dangerous.

00:50:34.031 --> 00:50:36.600 align:start size:97% position:3%
Not because transgender people
are dangerous, of course,

00:50:36.600 --> 00:50:39.403 align:start size:84% position:16%
but because biological
men pose dangers

00:50:39.403 --> 00:50:43.607
living in close quarters of
prison with biological women.

00:50:43.607 --> 00:50:46.109
- Yeah, which by the way, not
to get too political on you,

00:50:46.109 --> 00:50:47.310
but Joe Biden even said,

00:50:47.310 --> 00:50:49.012
you should be allowed to choose

00:50:49.012 --> 00:50:50.280
what prison you wanna go to

00:50:50.280 --> 00:50:53.116
based on your gender identity.

00:50:53.116 --> 00:50:54.251
I mean this is-

00:50:54.251 --> 00:50:56.486
- Yeah, I mean, look,

00:50:56.486 --> 00:50:58.355
I happen to think that,

00:50:58.355 --> 00:50:59.990
