00:51:02.192 --> 00:51:05.262 align:start size:88% position:13%
has got to be cruel
and unusual punishment.

00:51:05.262 --> 00:51:06.696
And yet we're seeing men

00:51:06.696 --> 00:51:10.267 align:start size:94% position:6%
who are even found guilty
of sexual violence,

00:51:10.267 --> 00:51:11.435
you know, sexual assault,

00:51:11.435 --> 00:51:13.503
housed with female prisoners.

00:51:13.503 --> 00:51:15.472
It's really unconscionable.

00:51:15.472 --> 00:51:17.808
- Yeah, so you do an
afterword in the book

00:51:17.808 --> 00:51:19.076
called the update.

00:51:19.076 --> 00:51:21.011
So what is the update?

00:51:21.011 --> 00:51:22.813
Where are we at right now?

00:51:22.813 --> 00:51:24.815 align:start size:84% position:16%
- (laughs) Well,
look, I think people

00:51:24.815 --> 00:51:26.316
are waking up to this issue.

00:51:26.316 --> 00:51:28.552
They're seeing that there's
very often peer influence.

00:51:28.552 --> 00:51:30.153
This is not organic.

00:51:30.153 --> 00:51:31.688
But right now,

00:51:31.688 --> 00:51:33.290
because this is being pumped
through the school systems,

00:51:33.290 --> 00:51:35.892
because kids are seeing
so much of, you know,

00:51:35.892 --> 00:51:38.295 align:start size:97% position:3%
getting so much encouragement
