00:51:41.965 --> 00:51:45.035 align:start size:97% position:3%
You know, young teens suddenly
deciding they're trans.

00:51:45.035 --> 00:51:46.303
And I would just say,

00:51:46.303 --> 00:51:48.738 align:start size:84% position:16%
