the same thing and whatnot,

00:51:53.443 --> 00:51:56.213
just be aware that there's
very often peer influence

00:51:56.213 --> 00:51:58.582 align:start size:81% position:19%
or social media
influence at play.

00:51:58.582 --> 00:52:00.684
- Yeah, well listen Abigail,
